# The template's requirements.txt, resolved as of its commit date (2025-12-04) with crewai pinned to
# 1.6.1, the release current then. crewai 1.15 makes a synchronous kickoff() inside a running event
# loop return a coroutine and fail, which the unmodified template does in its async job handler.
# masumi resolves to 0.1.41: 1.x passes the whole payment object to the status callback, which the
# template forwards to submit-result as blockchainIdentifier (rejected with HTTP 400).
# crewai 1.6 needs the litellm extra for OpenRouter models. pytest is for tests/test_shim.py.
fastapi
uvicorn
python-dotenv
crewai[litellm]==1.6.1
masumi
pydantic
python-multipart
httpx
pytest
